+   declared in px on purpose: a fingertip is not text and must not shrink with
+   the OS text-size preference.
+
+   THREE TECHNIQUES, in order of preference. Measure, then choose.
+
+   T1  direct box growth (min-height / width / height). The repo's existing
+       convention (.char-chip, .exp-row, .sh-stat-icon, #t-territory .adj,
+       .feed-adj, .gcp-pool-chip). Only safe where the box is genuinely
+       invisible: no background, border, box-shadow or visible radius, AND no
+       state variant (.on / :hover / :active / .filled) that paints one.
+       Used by gdx-3 for .pref-dot only (its rule stays in components.css).
