 379: +**Touch targets:** every interactive control on a player surface needs a hit area of at least
 380: +`var(--tap-min)` (44px, WCAG 2.5.5 AAA, declared in `theme.css`'s `:root`). Use the token, never a
 381: +bare `44px`. The three techniques and their traps are documented in one block at the end of
 382: +`public/css/suite.css` (search "TOUCH TARGETS"); read it before adding a new control.
 383: +
 384:  ### Shared Chrome Pattern
 385:  
 386:  When multiple classes share visual chrome (background, border, radius, padding) or shared text style (font, size, weight, letter-spacing), declare it once via a grouped selector rather than duplicating rule bodies.
