+## Ship assessment
+
+**Needs patches; not ready to ship as-is.** There are three blocking acceptance/runtime problems: the live collapsed-sidebar target is only 39×39px, wrapped ranking-pill targets overlap and can select a different pill, and adjacent Office stepper targets overlap by 12px and can invert the intended action. In addition, the required Playwright gate is reproducibly red at **34 passed / 13 failed**, with one failure added beyond the documented 12-failure baseline. The AC3 wording or the `.pref-dot` implementation must also change because they currently contradict each other.
