+- I did not perturb all six technique groups. The request required at least two; I ran T2 `::before` and T3, and both were restored exactly.
+- I did not run unrelated server or Vitest suites; the story identifies them as unchanged/irrelevant, while the specifically required Playwright file was run twice in full.
